        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s478",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · I took pics ... but the change visually ",
            "text": "I took pics ... but the change visually is not dramatic because my hair thinned over a larger general area. I never had bald spots, just noticeably thinner hair. I have been using a DHT blocking shampoo for about a year, so that reduced the hair loss ... what I really needed was new hair growth. I started seeing it in the front at the crown ... tiny little hairs ... those tiny little hairs are now, long hairs that noticeably have thickened my hair over my entire scalp. It's working, every day ... slow &amp;amp; steady wins the race! And I like that the Hair Rescuse formula doesn't make my hair feel stiff and dry ... other minoxidal treatments did ... l actually think sometimes the hair would break just because it was so stiff &amp;amp; stuck together. Good product good results so far!",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
